<section xml:id="section-caley-tables">
  <title>Caley Tables</title>
  <p>
    There is not new conceptual content in this section. It is just
    here to gather together the Caley tables in one place. In addition
    to the tables already expressed in the notes, I've added a number
    of other Caley tables that will be useful for the assignments. 
  </p>
  <example>
    <p>
+     The Caley table for <m>\ZZ/7\ZZ</m> under the
      operation of addition. 
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c| c c c c c c c }
        + \amp 0 \amp 1 \amp 2 \amp 3 \amp 4 \amp 5 \amp 6 \\
        \hline
        0 \amp 0 \amp 1 \amp 2 \amp 3 \amp 4 \amp 5 \amp 6 \\
        1 \amp 1 \amp 2 \amp 3 \amp 4 \amp 5 \amp 6 \amp 0 \\
        2 \amp 2 \amp 3 \amp 4 \amp 5 \amp 6 \amp 0 \amp 1 \\
        3 \amp 3 \amp 4 \amp 5 \amp 6 \amp 0 \amp 1 \amp 2 \\
        4 \amp 4 \amp 5 \amp 6 \amp 0 \amp 1 \amp 2 \amp 3 \\
        5 \amp 5 \amp 6 \amp 0 \amp 1 \amp 2 \amp 3 \amp 4 \\
        6 \amp 6 \amp 0 \amp 1 \amp 2 \amp 3 \amp 4 \amp 5 \\
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      The Caley table for <m>\ZZ/20\ZZ^*</m> under the
      operation of multiplication. 
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c| c c c c c c c c }
        \times \amp 1 \amp 3 \amp 7 \amp 9 \amp 11 \amp 13 \amp 17 \amp
        19  \\
        \hline
        1 \amp 1 \amp 3 \amp 7 \amp 9 \amp 11 \amp 13 \amp 17 \amp
        19 \\
        3 \amp 3 \amp 9 \amp 1 \amp 7 \amp 13 \amp 19 \amp 11 \amp
        17 \\
        7 \amp 7 \amp 1 \amp 9 \amp 3 \amp 17 \amp 11 \amp 19 \amp
        13 \\
        9 \amp 9 \amp 7 \amp 3 \amp 1 \amp 19 \amp 17 \amp 13 \amp
        11 \\
        11 \amp 11 \amp 13 \amp 17 \amp 19 \amp 1 \amp 3 \amp 7 \amp
        9 \\
        13 \amp 13 \amp 19 \amp 11 \amp 17 \amp 3 \amp 9 \amp 1 \amp
        7 \\
        17 \amp 17 \amp 11 \amp 19 \amp 13 \amp 7 \amp 1 \amp 9 \amp
        3 \\
        19 \amp 19 \amp 17 \amp 13 \amp 11 \amp 9 \amp 7 \amp 3 \amp
        1 \\
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      The Caley table for <m>\ZZ/2\ZZ \times \ZZ/2\ZZ</m> under the
      operation of addition.
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c|cccc}
        + \amp (0,0) \amp (1,0) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,1) \\
        \hline
        (0,0) \amp (0,0) \amp (1,0) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,1) \\
        (1,0) \amp (1,0) \amp (0,0) \amp (1,1) \amp (0,1) \\
        (0,1) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,1) \amp (0,0) \amp (1,0) \\
        (1,1) \amp (1,1) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,0) \amp (0,0) 
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      The Caley table for <m>\ZZ/3\ZZ \times \ZZ/4\ZZ</m> under the
      operation of addition.
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c|cccccccccccc}
        + \amp (0,0) \amp (1,0) \amp (2,0) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,1)
        \amp (2,1) \amp (0,2) \amp (1,2) \amp (2,2) \amp (0,3) \amp
        (1,3) \amp (2,3) \\
        \hline
        (0,0) \amp (0,0) \amp (1,0) \amp (2,0) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,1)
        \amp (2,1) \amp (0,2) \amp (1,2) \amp (2,2) \amp (0,3) \amp
        (1,3) \amp (2,3) \\
        (1,0) \amp (1,0) \amp (2,0) \amp (0,0) \amp (1,1) \amp (2,1)
        \amp (0,1) \amp (1,2) \amp (2,2) \amp (0,2) \amp (1,3) \amp
        (2,3) \amp (0,3) \\
        (2,0) \amp (2,0) \amp (0,0) \amp (1,0) \amp (2,1) \amp (0,1)
        \amp (1,1) \amp (2,2) \amp (0,2) \amp (1,2) \amp (2,3) \amp
        (0,3) \amp (1,3) \\
        (0,1) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,1) \amp (2,1) \amp (0,2) \amp (1,2)
        \amp (2,2) \amp (0,3) \amp (1,3) \amp (2,3) \amp (0,0) \amp
        (1,0) \amp (2,0) \\
        (1,1) \amp (1,1) \amp (2,1) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,2) \amp (2,2)
        \amp (0,2) \amp (1,3) \amp (2,3) \amp (0,3) \amp (1,0) \amp
        (2,0) \amp (0,0) \\
        (2,1) \amp (2,1) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,1) \amp (2,2) \amp (0,2)
        \amp (1,2) \amp (2,3) \amp (0,3) \amp (1,3) \amp (2,0) \amp
        (0,0) \amp (1,0) \\
        (0,2) \amp (0,2) \amp (1,2) \amp (2,2) \amp (0,3) \amp (1,3)
        \amp (2,3) \amp (0,0) \amp (1,0) \amp (2,0) \amp (0,1) \amp
        (1,1) \amp (2,1) \\
        (1,2) \amp (1,2) \amp (2,2) \amp (0,2) \amp (1,3) \amp (2,3)
        \amp (0,3) \amp (1,0) \amp (2,0) \amp (0,0) \amp (1,1) \amp
        (2,1) \amp (0,1) \\
        (2,2) \amp (2,2) \amp (0,2) \amp (1,2) \amp (2,3) \amp (0,3)
        \amp (1,3) \amp (2,0) \amp (0,0) \amp (1,0) \amp (2,1) \amp
        (0,1) \amp (1,1) \\
        (0,3) \amp (0,3) \amp (1,3) \amp (2,3) \amp (0,0) \amp (1,0)
        \amp (2,0) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,1) \amp (2,1) \amp (0,2) \amp
        (1,2) \amp (2,2) \\
        (1,3) \amp (1,3) \amp (2,3) \amp (0,3) \amp (1,0) \amp (2,0)
        \amp (0,0) \amp (1,1) \amp (2,1) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,2) \amp
        (2,2) \amp (0,2) \\
        (2,3) \amp (2,3) \amp (0,3) \amp (1,3) \amp (2,0) \amp (0,0)
        \amp (1,0) \amp (2,1) \amp (0,1) \amp (1,1) \amp (2,2) \amp
        (0,2) \amp (1,2) 
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      The Caley table for <m>D_3</m> under the operation of
      composition. 
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c|cccccc}
        \circ \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \\
        \hline
        \Id \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \\
        R_1 \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp \Id \amp F_3 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \\
        R_2 \amp R_2 \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_1 \\
        F_1 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp \Id \amp F_3 \amp F_2 \\
        F_2 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_1 \amp F_3 \amp \Id \amp F_1 \\
        F_3 \amp F_3 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_2 \amp F_1 \amp \Id 
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      The Caley table for <m>D_4</m> under the operation of
      composition.
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c|cccccccc}
        \circ \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp 
                   F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \\
        \hline
        \Id \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp 
                 F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \\
        R_1 \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp \Id \amp 
                 F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \amp F_1 \\
        R_2 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp 
                 F_3 \amp F_4 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \\
        R_3 \amp R_3 \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp 
                 F_4 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \\
        F_1 \amp F_1 \amp F_4 \amp F_3 \amp F_2 \amp 
                 \Id \amp R_3 \amp R_2 \amp R_1 \\
        F_2 \amp F_2 \amp F_1 \amp F_4 \amp F_3 \amp 
                 R_1 \amp \Id \amp R_3 \amp R_2 \\
        F_3 \amp F_3 \amp F_2 \amp F_1 \amp F_4 \amp 
                 R_2 \amp R_2 \amp \Id \amp R_3 \\
        F_4 \amp F_4 \amp F_3 \amp F_2 \amp F_1 \amp 
                 R_3 \amp R_3 \amp R_1 \amp \Id 
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      The Caley table for <m>D_5</m> under the operation of
      composition.
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c|cccccccccc}
        \circ \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp 
                    F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \amp F_5 \\
        \hline
        \Id \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp 
                 F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \amp F_5 \\
        R_1 \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp \Id \amp 
                 F_4 \amp F_5 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \\
        R_2 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp 
                 F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \amp F_5 \amp F_1 \\
        R_3 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp 
                 F_5 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \\
        R_4 \amp R_4 \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp 
                 F_3 \amp F_4 \amp F_5 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \\
        F_1 \amp F_1 \amp F_3 \amp F_5 \amp F_2 \amp F_4 \amp 
                 \Id \amp R_3 \amp R_1 \amp R_4 \amp R_2 \\
        F_2 \amp F_2 \amp F_4 \amp F_1 \amp F_3 \amp F_5 \amp 
                 R_2 \amp \Id \amp R_3 \amp R_1 \amp R_4 \\
        F_3 \amp F_3 \amp F_5 \amp F_2 \amp F_4 \amp F_1 \amp 
                 R_4 \amp R_2 \amp \Id \amp R_3 \amp R_1 \\
        F_4 \amp F_4 \amp F_1 \amp F_3 \amp F_5 \amp F_2 \amp 
                 R_1 \amp R_4 \amp R_2 \amp \Id \amp R_3 \\
        F_5 \amp F_5 \amp F_2 \amp F_4 \amp F_1 \amp F_3 \amp 
                 R_5 \amp R_1 \amp R_4 \amp R_2 \amp \Id 
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      The Caley table for <m>D_6</m> under the operation of
      composition.
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c|cccccccccccc}
        \circ \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp R_5
        \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp
        F_4 \amp F_5 \amp F_6 \\
        \hline
        \Id \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp R_5 \amp
        F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \amp F_5 \amp F_6 \\
        R_1 \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp R_5 \amp \Id \amp
        F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \amp F_5 \amp F_6 \amp F_1 \\
        R_2 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp R_5 \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp
        F_3 \amp F_4 \amp F_5 \amp F_6 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \\
        R_3 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp R_5 \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp
        F_4 \amp F_5 \amp F_6 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \\
        R_4 \amp R_4 \amp R_5 \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp
        F_5 \amp F_6 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \\
        R_5 \amp R_5 \amp \Id \amp R_1 \amp R_2 \amp R_3 \amp R_4 \amp
        F_6 \amp F_1 \amp F_2 \amp F_3 \amp F_4 \amp F_5 \\
        F_1 \amp F_1 \amp F_6 \amp F_5 \amp F_4 \amp F_3 \amp F_2 \amp
        \Id \amp R_5 \amp R_4 \amp R_3 \amp R_2 \amp R_1 \\
        F_2 \amp F_2 \amp F_1 \amp F_6 \amp F_5 \amp F_4 \amp F_3 \amp
        R_1 \amp \Id \amp R_5 \amp R_4 \amp R_3 \amp R_2 \\
        F_3 \amp F_3 \amp F_2 \amp F_1 \amp F_6 \amp F_5 \amp F_4 \amp
        R_2 \amp R_1 \amp \Id \amp R_5 \amp R_4 \amp R_3 \\
        F_4 \amp F_4 \amp F_3 \amp F_2 \amp F_1 \amp F_6 \amp F_5 \amp
        R_3 \amp R_2 \amp R_1 \amp \Id \amp R_5 \amp R_4 \\
        F_5 \amp F_5 \amp F_4 \amp F_3 \amp F_2 \amp F_1 \amp F_6 \amp
        R_4 \amp R_3 \amp R_2 \amp R_1 \amp \Id \amp R_5 \\
        F_6 \amp F_6 \amp F_5 \amp F_4 \amp F_3 \amp F_2 \amp F_1 \amp
        R_5 \amp R_4 \amp R_3 \amp R_2 \amp R_1 \amp \Id 
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      The Caley table for <m>A_3</m> under the operation of
      composition.
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c|ccc}
        \circ \amp \Id \amp (123) \amp (132) \\
        \hline
        \Id   \amp \Id   \amp (123) \amp (132) \\
        (123) \amp (123) \amp (132) \amp \Id \\
        (132) \amp (132) \amp \Id \amp (123) 
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      The Caley table for <m>S_3</m> under the operation of
      composition.
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c|cccccc}
        \circ \amp \Id \amp (12) \amp (13) \amp (23) \amp (123) \amp
        (132) \\
        \hline
        \Id \amp \Id \amp (12) \amp (13) \amp (23) \amp (123) \amp
        (132) \\
        (12) \amp (12) \amp \Id \amp (132) \amp (123) \amp (23) \amp
        (13) \\
        (13) \amp (13) \amp (123) \amp \Id \amp (132) \amp (12) \amp
        (23) \\
        (23) \amp (23) \amp (132) \amp (123) \amp \Id \amp (13) \amp
        (12) \\
        (123) \amp (123) \amp (13) \amp (23) \amp (13) \amp (132) \amp
        \Id \\
        (132) \amp (132) \amp (23) \amp (12) \amp (13) \amp \Id \amp
        (123) 
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      The Caley table for <m>A_4</m> under the operation of
      composition.
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c|cccccccccccc}
        \circ \amp \Id \amp (12)(34) \amp (13)(24) \amp (14)(23)
        \amp(123) \amp (124) \amp (134) \amp (234) \amp (132) \amp
        (142) \amp (143) \amp (243) \\
        \hline
        \Id \amp \Id \amp (12)(34) \amp (13)(24) \amp (14)(23) \amp (123)
        \amp (124) \amp (134) \amp (234) \amp (132) \amp (142) \amp (143)
        \amp (243) \\
        (12)(34) \amp (12)(34) \amp \Id \amp (14)(23) \amp (13)(24)
        \amp (243) \amp (234) \amp (142) \amp (124) \amp (143) \amp
        (134) \amp (132  \amp (123)\\
        (13)(24) \amp (13)(24) \amp (14)(23) \amp \Id \amp (12)(34)
        \amp (142) \amp (143) \amp (243) \amp (132) \amp (234) \amp
        (123) \amp (124) \amp (134) \\
        (14)(23) \amp (14)(23) \amp (13)(24) \amp (12)(34) \amp \Id
        \amp(134) \amp (132) \amp (123) \amp (143) \amp (124) \amp
        (243) \amp (234) \amp (142) \\
        (123) \amp (123) \amp (134) \amp (243) \amp (142) \amp (132)
        \amp (13)(24) \amp (234) \amp (12)(34) \amp \Id \amp (143)
        \amp (14)(23) \amp (124) \\
        (124) \amp (124) \amp (143) \amp (132) \amp (234) \amp
        (14)(23) \amp (142) \amp (13)(24) \amp (123) \amp (134)
        \amp \Id \amp (243) \amp (12)(34) \\
        (134) \amp (134) \amp (123) \amp (142) \amp (243) \amp (124)
        \amp (12)(34) \amp (143) \amp (13)(24) \amp (14)(23) \amp
        (234) \amp \Id \amp (132) \\
        (234) \amp (234) \amp (132) \amp (143) \amp (124) \amp
        (13)(24) \amp (134) \amp (14)(23) \amp (243) \amp (142)
        \amp(12)(34) \amp (123) \amp \Id \\
        (132) \amp (132) \amp (234) \amp (124) \amp (143) \amp \Id
        \amp (243) \amp (12)(34) \amp (134) \amp (123) \amp (14)(23)
        \amp (142) \amp (13)(24) \\
        (142) \amp (142) \amp (243) \amp (134) \amp (123) \amp (234)
        \amp \Id \amp (132) \amp (14)(23) \amp (13)(24) \amp (124)
        \amp(12)(34) \amp (143) \\
        (143) \amp (143) \amp (124) \amp (234) \amp (132) \amp
        (12)(34) \amp (123) \amp \Id \amp (142) \amp (243)
        \amp(13)(24) \amp (134) \amp (14)(23) \\
        (243) \amp (243) \amp (142) \amp (123) \amp (134) \amp (143)
        \amp (14)(23) \amp (124) \amp \Id \amp (12)(34) \amp (132)
        \amp (13)(24) \amp (234)
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
  <example>
    <p>
      This is the Caley table for <m>Q</m>, the quaternion group. 
    </p>
    <md>
      \begin{array}{c|cccccccc}
        \cdot \amp 1 \amp -1 \amp i \amp -i \amp j \amp -j \amp k
        \amp -k \\
        \hline
        1 \amp 1 \amp -1 \amp i \amp -i \amp j \amp -j \amp k \amp
        -k \\[0.2em]
        -1 \amp -1 \amp 1 \amp -i \amp i \amp -j \amp j \amp -k \amp 
        k \\[0.2em]
        i \amp i \amp -i \amp -1 \amp 1 \amp k \amp -k \amp -j \amp 
        j \\[0.2em]
        -i \amp -i \amp i \amp 1 \amp -1 \amp -k \amp k \amp j \amp 
        -j \\[0.2em]
        j \amp j \amp -j \amp -k \amp k \amp -1 \amp 1 \amp i \amp 
        -i \\[0.2em]
        -j \amp -j \amp j \amp k \amp -k \amp 1 \amp -1 \amp -i \amp 
        i \\[0.2em]
        k \amp k \amp -k \amp j \amp -j \amp -i \amp i \amp -1 \amp 
        1 \\[0.2em]
        -k \amp -k \amp k \amp -j \amp j \amp i \amp -i \amp 1 \amp 
        -1
      \end{array}
    </md>
  </example>
</section>
